# a text scenario: Settings, the Network page (long: Wi-Fi, firewall, sharing), skipped when it fits; the wheel scrolls it down and then back up (nothing is changed)
name: settings-wheel-network
devices: real qemu
restore: none (read-only)
doc: opens the Network page of Settings; when it shows a scrollbar the wheel must move it down and the opposite turn must move it back
key s
wait app=Settings
skip-unless-button Network
click-sidebar Network
wait app=Settings page=Network
shot top
skip-unless-scrollbar
scroll down
shot lower
expect-changed
expect-scrollbar
scroll up
shot back
expect-changed
expect-scrollbar
